✅ MERGED TO DEV (2026-07-26) — two features, while the CRAN-prep hold stands
PR #30 `rg_flow_contrast()`/`RgFlowResult` (d8fd376) — scale-indexed classical
proportion mediated (NIE/TE ratio, NOT P_med) with cluster-robust EIF inference;
probmed's first multilevel estimator. 458/458 tests passing (+44 over the 414
baseline, no regressions). Data-contract question left OPEN on purpose: g_l
refits at every scale and needs raw clustered data + cluster labels, which
medfit::MediationData doesn't carry (fitted paths only) — resolve via a
data.frame/matrix + cluster-label API (current) vs. extending MediationData with
a cluster slot, later.
PR #31 `multilevel_designs` (31536f2) — probmed's first shipped dataset: 3-row
cluster-design metadata table (ECLS-K:1998-99, ECLS-K:2011, mediation::student).
Reviewed and merged on green CI (8/8 checks); one drive-by fix applied during
review (DESCRIPTION field ordering + a roxygen-skew note, commit 5c26932). Two
open questions from the PR body carried forward, not resolved: D1 (dataset
naming convention — first shipped data, no prior art) and Q6 (does the table
grow beyond 3 rows, and does mediation::student belong beside the two NCES
cohorts). Author confirmed keeping R >= 3.5 floor, the free-text sampling_note
schema, and the student row as merged.

